      "zh": {
        "title": "歐洲至少25班客運航班遭炸彈威脅 多地戰機護航",
        "summary": "11月5日歐洲至少25班客運航班遭炸彈威脅，多地戰機護航並有航班改降。",
        "body": [
          "AeroTime報導，2026年11月5日，歐洲至少25班客運航班遭炸彈威脅。報導列出的受影響航空公司包括Aer Lingus、Finnair、Ryanair、Wizz Air及LOT Polish Airlines。法國、義大利與保加利亞有戰機護航，另有三班航班改降。",
          "截至上午稍晚，部分已完成的搜索未發現爆裂物，其他地點的檢查仍在進行。當局尚未公開確認責任人身分，也未確定各起威脅是否彼此相關。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "At least 25 European passenger flights targeted by bomb threats; fighter escorts reported",
        "summary": "At least 25 European passenger flights faced bomb threats; fighter escorts and diversions were reported.",
        "body": [
          "According to AeroTime, at least 25 passenger flights were targeted by bomb threats across Europe on November 5, 2026. The report said the affected flights were operated by Aer Lingus, Finnair, Ryanair, Wizz Air and LOT Polish Airlines. Fighter escorts were reported in France, Italy and Bulgaria, and the report counted three diversions.",
          "Searches completed by late morning in several locations found no explosives, while checks remained under way elsewhere. Authorities had not publicly identified those responsible or established whether the incidents were connected."
        ]
